<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS1.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5.1 Grounding efficiency ‣ 5 Results ‣ Measuring How (Not Just Whether) VLMs Build Common Ground" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Round-level performance.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS1.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.1 Grounding efficiency ‣ 5 Results ‣ Measuring How (Not Just Whether) VLMs Build Common Ground" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Does prompt tuning increase grounding efficiency?</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS2" title="In 5 Results ‣ Measuring How (Not Just Whether) VLMs Build Common Ground" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.2 </span>Content alignment</span></a>
